### How the skill uses this rubric
1. Author to the constitution by default.
2. Self-run every applicable checkbox; fix each FAIL or justify it (hard blockers: no override).
3. Emit the Definition-of-Done block above as evidence.
4. The **hooks** enforce the `[TOOL]` half deterministically; the rubric makes the `[SELF]` half checkable.
